Subject: [PATCH] Refs #566: Apply reviewed CSV contact fix after current task
 aliases

Adapt the previously reviewed 73af57871683d750a74fcd449cd5a5270109ab70 contact fix onto 14bc2fa1330037120f98b6dc31c76f5690a29eb6. Resolve three-way context conflicts by retaining current task priority/status aliases, H/N mappings and LotusTaskCsvTests registration. Contact functions, fixtures and regression tests match the historical fix byte for byte.

Validation: 11 Python cases and both C# CSV groups pass together, covering eight contacts and fourteen current task rows. This remains the scoped CSV part of #566; it is not a resolution of the historical private OR6/UI conflict.
